    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Security Investigation Workflow",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Investigation Workflow\n\n1. Identify the suspicious signal in the summary row.\n2. Review the matching trend panel.\n3. Inspect the related Loki event timeline.\n4. Extract `request_id`, `trace_id`, source IP, user, role, endpoint, or error category.\n5. Search the same identifier in Loki.\n6. Use Tempo for trace correlation when a `trace_id` is present.\n7. Confirm scope, timeline, affected service, and likely root cause.\n8. Document findings and response action.\n"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Security Events - 5m",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
